  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979852",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-68167",
      "knowledge_point_id": "231604dc-fe8f-59be-90fe-37af7a1bb648",
      "knowledge_point": "Identifying When a Rational Function has no Vertical Asymptotes",
      "problem": "Find the vertical asymptotes of $f(x)=\\frac{3x-2{x}^{2}}{18-12x}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's simplify the expression by factoring both the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3x-2{x}^{2}}{18-12x} & =\\frac{x(3-2x)}{6(3-2x)}=\\frac{x}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the denominator is never zero, we conclude that this function has no vertical asymptotes. A plot of the function is below. Note that it is not defined at $x=\\frac{3}{2}.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979852/assets/04c9f0c0e0f8ee16e9eee949d23a816b9ad877ab205d3231bb183a486da97544.png)",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-6",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=\\frac{3}{2}",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "No vertical asymptotes",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=-\\frac{3}{4}",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "6",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "difficulty": "moderate",
      "provenance": {
        "activity_question": "question-68167",
        "kp_title": "Identifying When a Rational Function has no Vertical Asymptotes",
        "kp_href": null
      },
      "topic_id": 1815,
