  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979852",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-107074",
      "knowledge_point_id": "68ba4c5d-8b91-57bc-b98b-0e9f8d8f1f67",
      "knowledge_point": "Determining the Vertical Asymptotes for the Sum of Two Rational Functions",
      "problem": "Find the vertical asymptotes of $f(x)=\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+3}-\\frac{1}{2{x}^{2}+1}.$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's put the two terms over a common denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+3}-\\frac{1}{2{x}^{2}+1} & =\\frac{(2{x}^{2}+1)-({x}^{2}+3)}{({x}^{2}+3)(2{x}^{2}+1)}=\\frac{{x}^{2}-2}{({x}^{2}+3)(2{x}^{2}+1)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere are no common factors in the numerator and denominator, so we proceed to set the denominator equal to zero and get\n\n$$\n({x}^{2}+3)(2{x}^{2}+1)=0.\n$$\n\nThis equation has no real solutions, therefore $f(x)$ has no vertical asymptotes.",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=\\sqrt{2}",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=\\frac{1}{2}",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "No vertical asymptotes",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "$x=-\\sqrt{2}$ and $x=\\sqrt{2}$",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "$x=\\sqrt{3}$ and $x=\\frac{1}{2}$",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "difficulty": "moderate",
      "provenance": {
        "activity_question": "question-107074",
